  "fullDescription": "Emotive Type is an elegant modern serif typeface crafted for expressive headlines and refined visual storytelling. Featuring tall proportions, high contrast strokes, and delicately sculpted serifs, this font blends contemporary minimalism with a poetic, editorial sensibility.\n\nDesigned to feel calm yet confident, Emotive Type shines in fashion editorials, luxury branding, magazines, art books, posters, and sophisticated digital layouts. Its graceful curves and balanced spacing create a soft rhythm that allows typography to speak quietly but with intention.\n\nThe typeface includes uppercase and lowercase characters, numerals, punctuation, and extensive multilingual support, making it suitable for global creative projects. Delivered in .otf font files, Emotive Type works seamlessly across all major design software.\n\nEmotive Type is built for designers who value atmosphere, nuance, and timeless elegance—where emotion is embedded in every letterform.",
